  "body": "If you've been searching for a quality home in a premium Bays location, it's worth taking another look at this one. Fully renovated, with spectacular sea views and exceptional outdoor living, just moments from Churchill Cove and the beach, this is a home that deserves your attention. \r\n\r\nPresented in near-new condition, with a flexible layout and superb indoor-outdoor flow. There’s also a double internal-access garage, excellent storage, boat space and additional off-street parking. \r\n\r\nZoned for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Primary and Intermediate, with easy access to nearby Private schooling options.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is ready to move on — and that could be your gain. If the location, views and sought after school zones have been on your wish list, don't leave this one sitting on it — come and see why.\r\n\r\nPlease note: Some images have been edited with AI\r\nAll agents welcome - conjunctions invited. \r\n\r\nMarketed by: Tara Menzies and Cindy Leong",
